---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy - Daily Work Hack',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-6 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <header class="mb-8 md:mb-12 text-center">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200"
      >
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Last updated: October 16, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div
      class="mx-auto prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6"
    >
      <p>
        At <strong>Daily Work Hack</strong> (accessible from <a
          href="https://work.storydailyview.com"
          class="text-primary hover:underline">https://work.storydailyview.com</a
        >), the privacy of our visitors is one of our main priorities. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types
        of information that is collected and recorded by Daily Work Hack and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        Daily Work Hack operates as an independent technical and digital publication. We may collect non-personally
        identifiable information automatically via standard web server logs and analytics tools, including browser type,
        referring/exit pages, operating system, date/time stamps, and clickstream data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
      <p>
        Like any other website, Daily Work Hack uses 'cookies'. These cookies are used to store information including
        visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The information is
        used to optimize the users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and
        other details.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">3. Google AdSense & Advertising Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Google is one of the third-party vendors on our site. It uses cookies, known as advertising cookies, to serve
        ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to Daily Work Hack and other sites on the internet. Visitors may
        choose to decline or opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting <a
          href="https://adssettings.google.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-primary hover:underline">Google Ad Settings</a
        > or <a
          href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-primary hover:underline">AboutAds.info</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">4. Third-Party Content & Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We may partner with third-party analytics providers (such as Google Analytics) to help understand website
        traffic and usage patterns. These services may collect information sent by your browser as part of a web page
        request. Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technologies like cookies, JavaScript, or Web Beacons in
        their respective advertisements and links.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">5. Contact Us</h2>
      <!--email_off-->
      <p>
        If you have any questions or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out directly via our contact
        email: <span>contact</span>&#64;<span>storydailyview.com</span>
      </p>
      <!--/email_off-->
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
